            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Wet your hands with clean, running water. Apply a small amount of hand soap. Lather the soap by rubbing hands together. Scrub for at least 20 seconds. Rinse hands well. Dry hands using a clean, dry towel.</p>",
