        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p><strong>Charcoal Filtered Deionized Water </strong>• High-purity water.</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong> • Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming,<br/>and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine </strong>• Naturally derived from<br/>coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and<br/>biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.</p><p><strong>Sodium C14-C16 Olefin Sulfonate</strong> • Derived from<br/>coconuts and palm-free, this mild-surfactant helps to lift dirt and debris from<br/>surfaces, while not leaving skin dry like a harsh surfactant may. </p><p><strong>Decyl Glucoside </strong>• A plant-derived, biodegradable<br/>surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.</p><p><strong>Vegetable Glycerin</strong> • Derived from vegetables. It is<br/>biodegradable and helps keep skin moisturized naturally. Food-grade & USP<br/>kosher.</p><p><strong>Polyquaternium 10 </strong>• a lightweight skin conditioner<br/>that helps prevent dryness</p><p><strong>Sodium Gluconate </strong>• a natural mineral that helps remove<br/>minerals from hard water</p><p><strong>Sodium Citrate </strong>• a natural mineral that helps remove<br/>minerals from hard water</p><p><strong>Capryl Caprylyl Glucoside</strong> • A biodegradable<br/>plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.</p><p><strong>Polysorbate 20</strong> • Plant-based surfactant that helps<br/>stabilize the formula when adding essential oils or phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable.<br/>Kosher. Food-Grade. 100% Dioxane-free.</em></p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol & Phenoxyethanol </strong>• Safe<br/>preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container.</p><p><strong>Citric Acid</strong> • Balances pH for gentle hand care</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><strong>Unscented</strong><br/>Contains no essential oils or phthalate-free fragrance oils</p><p><strong>Citrus Bliss (Orange/Lemon</strong> )<br/>Citrus Sinensis (Sweet Orange) Oil, Citrus Limon (Lemon) Oil</p><p><strong>Lavender Fields (Lavender)<br/></strong>Lavandula Stoechas (French Lavender) Oil, Lavandula Latifolia (Portuguese Lavender) Herb Oil, Lavandula Angustifolia (Common Lavender) Oil, Lavandula Hybrida (Hybrid Lavender) Oil</p><p><strong>Invigorating (Peppermint/Lime)<br/></strong>Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil,<br/>Citrus Aurantifolia (Lime) Oil</p><p><strong>Soothing Herbs (Lavender/Rosemary)<br/></strong>Lavandula Stoechas (French Lavender) Oil, Lavandula Latifolia (Portuguese Lavender) Herb Oil, Lavandula Angustifolia (Common Lavender) Oil, Lavandula Hybrida (Hybrid Lavender) Oil,<br/>Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil</p>",
