            "content": "<p>Our eco jug (80%PCR) 5-gallon pails, and 1-gallon glass dispensing jugs are designed for you to<strong> reuse in your business for years. </strong>You may return them to us any time, sell them or give them away to be upcycled when you are ready.</p><p><br/>The 4 1-gallon option seems counterproductive to our mission but rest assured it is not.<br/>If you purchase these containers, just hold onto the box that they come in.  Use up the product you purchased. <strong>Send the empty 1-gallon plastic containers back to us in this box we will sanitize, refill, and reuse them.</strong></p>",
